"1","GPIO","NA","gpio_reg_wr_rd_test","Sequentially read the GPIO GP0 register block across offsets 0x0 to 0x4C and record the values.","The test performs read operations for each GPIO GP0 register macro resolved to base 0xA001A000 with offsets {0x0, 0x4, 0x8, 0xC, 0x10, 0x14, 0x18, 0x1C, 0x20, 0x24, 0x28, 0x2C, 0x30, 0x34, 0x38, 0x3C, 0x40, 0x44, 0x48, 0x4C}. For each macro (MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_8 through MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_27), compute effective address = 0xA001A000 + offset and perform a read; capture/log the returned value. No writes, waits, or interrupt handling are involved per the provided inputs.","NA","NA","0x0","0x4C","NA","1) Identify the GPIO GP0 base address (0xA001A000). 2) Read 32-bit values at offsets 0x0 to 0x4C in 0x4 increments and record results. 3) Archive the collected readback values for review.","1) For each macro in order: {MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_8@0x0, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_9@0x4, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_10@0x8, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_11@0xC, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_12@0x10, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_13@0x14, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_14@0x18, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_15@0x1C, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_16@0x20, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_17@0x24, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_18@0x28, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_19@0x2C, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_20@0x30, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_21@0x34, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_22@0x38, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_23@0x3C, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_24@0x40, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_25@0x44, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_26@0x48, MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_27@0x4C}: a) Compute effective address = 0xA001A000 + <offset>. b) Issue a 32-bit read from the effective address. c) Store/log the read value with the corresponding macro/offset. 2) No conditional branches, writes, delays, or ISR interactions are specified. 3) Completion occurs after the final read (offset 0x4C).","NA","MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_8;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_9;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_10;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_11;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_12;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_13;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_14;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_15;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_16;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_17;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_18;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_19;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_20;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_21;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_22;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_23;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_24;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_25;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_26;MIZAR_GPIO_GP0_GPIO_27","NA","NA","Not","NA","#define GPIO0 1","NA"